.* CMDMSGHDL: Message Handling Commands, a group of the major command menu.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 3'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='CMDMSGHDL'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAJOR'.F16=Major menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CMDMSGHDL HELP=HLPCMDMSGHDL KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' PANELID=PANELID.Message Handling Commands
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUGRP.Related Command Menus
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='MENU CMDLOG' HELP='CMDMSGHDL/OPT1'.Log Commands  CMDLOG
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='MENU CMDMSG' HELP='CMDMSGHDL/OPT2'.Message Commands  CMDMSG
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='MENU CMDMSGD' HELP='CMDMSGHDL/OPT3'.Message Description Commands  CMDMSGD
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='MENU CMDMSGF' HELP='CMDMSGHDL/OPT4'.Message File Commands  CMDMSGF
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='MENU CMDMSGQ' HELP='CMDMSGHDL/OPT5'.Message Queue Commands  CMDMSGQ
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='MENU CMDRPY' HELP='CMDMSGHDL/OPT6'.Reply Commands  CMDRPY
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='MENU CMDRPYL' HELP='CMDMSGHDL/OPT7'.Reply List Commands  CMDRPYL
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCMDMSGHDL.Message Handling Commands - Help
:P.Message Handling Commands: the commands and the command menus of this
group, as the major command menu arranges them, with each name at the
right of its row. A blank row is a command this release does not
provide.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter to prompt the command or show the
menu, or type a command on the command line. F12 returns to the previous
menu, F3 to the menu where you started and F16 to the major command
groups.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F16=Major menu
:PD.Shows menu MAJOR.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDMSGHDL/OPT1'.Log Commands  CMDLOG
:P.Option 1. Shows menu CMDLOG&colon. Log Commands CMDLOG.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDMSGHDL/OPT2'.Message Commands  CMDMSG
:P.Option 2. Shows menu CMDMSG&colon. Message Commands CMDMSG.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDMSGHDL/OPT3'.Message Description Commands  CMDMSGD
:P.Option 3. Shows menu CMDMSGD&colon. Message Description Commands
CMDMSGD.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDMSGHDL/OPT4'.Message File Commands  CMDMSGF
:P.Option 4. Shows menu CMDMSGF&colon. Message File Commands CMDMSGF.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDMSGHDL/OPT5'.Message Queue Commands  CMDMSGQ
:P.Option 5. Shows menu CMDMSGQ&colon. Message Queue Commands CMDMSGQ.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDMSGHDL/OPT6'.Reply Commands  CMDRPY
:P.Option 6. Shows menu CMDRPY&colon. Reply Commands CMDRPY.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDMSGHDL/OPT7'.Reply List Commands  CMDRPYL
:P.Option 7. Shows menu CMDRPYL&colon. Reply List Commands CMDRPYL.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
